{"id":"6a5374048e3f33d2","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-ideal-prime-ideal-on-boolean.md","title":"ZFC Ideal Prime Ideal On Boolean","display":"df-zfc-ideal-prime-ideal-on-boolean — ZFC Ideal Prime Ideal On Boolean","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-prime-ideal-on-boolean","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-prime-ideal-on-boolean"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-prime-ideal-on-boolean — ZFC Ideal Prime Ideal On Boolean","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-prime-ideal-on-boolean"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-prime-ideal-on-boolean</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-prime-ideal-on-boolean — ZFC Ideal Prime Ideal On Boolean"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\mathbb B,B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V\">\\(I,\\mathbb B,B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle\\)</span> is an encoded Boolean algebra</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\)</span> is the Boolean-algebra predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealPrimeIdealOnBoolean}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealPrimeIdealOnBoolean}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}on\\text{-}boolean}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdealPrimeIdealOnBoolean}_S(I,\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\;\\bigl(&amp;\\mathbb B=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land I\\subseteq B\\land0\\in I\\land1\\notin I\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;\\bigl((a\\in I\\land b\\in I\\to a\\vee b\\in I)\n\\land(a\\wedge b=a\\land b\\in I\\to a\\in I)\n\\land(a\\wedge b\\in I\\to a\\in I\\lor b\\in I)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}on\\text{-}boolean}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdealPrimeIdealOnBoolean}_S(I,\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\;\\bigl(&amp;\\mathbb B=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land I\\subseteq B\\land0\\in I\\land1\\notin I\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;\\bigl((a\\in I\\land b\\in I\\to a\\vee b\\in I)\n\\land(a\\wedge b=a\\land b\\in I\\to a\\in I)\n\\land(a\\wedge b\\in I\\to a\\in I\\lor b\\in I)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier and all Boolean operations are recovered from the encoded algebra; primeness is stated only after the proper-ideal closure clauses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)$ is the Boolean-algebra predicate (see [[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\mathbb B,B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealPrimeIdealOnBoolean}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}prime\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}on\\text{-}boolean}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdealPrimeIdealOnBoolean}_S(I,\\mathbb B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\;\\bigl(&\\mathbb B=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land I\\subseteq B\\land0\\in I\\land1\\notin I\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall a,b\\in B\\;\\bigl((a\\in I\\land b\\in I\\to a\\vee b\\in I)\n\\land(a\\wedge b=a\\land b\\in I\\to a\\in I)\n\\land(a\\wedge b\\in I\\to a\\in I\\lor b\\in I)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1454,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2281","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-ideal-prime-ideal-on-boolean.md|58-df-zfc-ideal-prime-ideal-on-boolean]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a5e10857074b912e"]}